# Frozen in Ice: "Enchanted creature ... can't become untapped" (CR 101.2, 701.26b) holds against an effect, not only the
# untap step. Bot1's Ornithopter is frozen on turn 1 (Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U}); on turn 3 Giant-Sized Flying Ant's
# "Untap target nonland permanent" is aimed at it and does nothing: it stays tapped (the other scenario of the Ant shows the
# same ability untapping a Mox that is not frozen).

